      "updated": 1791480000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Plain language: start with a ready-made example, make a copy, and change only what is different.\nUse Prototype when similar objects are costly or tedious to configure repeatedly. A clone is a new object; modifying it should not unexpectedly modify the template.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Plain language: start with a ready-made example, make a copy, and change only what is different.\nUse Prototype when similar objects are costly or tedious to configure repeatedly. A clone is a new object; modifying it should not unexpectedly modify the template.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a1"
