      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE PROBLEM — WITHOUT PROTOTYPE\nCreate every similar game character from scratch.\n\nRepeatedly set health, attack power, level, and other defaults; each new variation duplicates setup logic.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 16,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "THE PROBLEM — WITHOUT PROTOTYPE\nCreate every similar game character from scratch.\n\nRepeatedly set health, attack power, level, and other defaults; each new variation duplicates setup logic.",
