      "updated": 1791480000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Prepare a GameCharacter template with reusable defaults.\n2. Call clone() to produce an independent copy of that concrete character.\n3. Change only the copy's name or stats; keep the original template as-is for the next clone.\n\nThis example's fields are values/strings, so copying them produces independent state. If prototypes hold pointers or shared resources, decide whether cloning should be shallow or deep.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 16,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Prepare a GameCharacter template with reusable defaults.\n2. Call clone() to produce an independent copy of that concrete character.\n3. Change only the copy's name or stats; keep the original template as-is for the next clone.\n\nThis example's fields are values/strings, so copying them produces independent state. If prototypes hold pointers or shared resources, decide whether cloning should be shallow or deep.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "aI"
    },
    {
      "id": "tradeoffs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 75,
      "y": 1180,
      "width": 1320,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 20,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 520,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791480000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TRADE-OFFS\nClone is not automatically faster than constructing an object; its value is reusing complex prepared state. Deep-copy behavior needs deliberate design. Use a simple constructor when the object is cheap and easy to configure.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TRADE-OFFS\nClone is not automatically faster than constructing an object; its value is reusing complex prepared state. Deep-copy behavior needs deliberate design. Use a simple constructor when the object is cheap and easy to configure.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "aJ"
    }
  ],
